# Agent State Backup Rules

- Never commit files matching `*.env`, `secrets/*`, `*.pem`, or `state.db*`.
- Ensure all backup automation scripts verify Git status before pushing.
- Exclude cache, scratch, and binary audio folders from backup mirrors.
